    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Tandzile Simelane is the first doctor in her extended family. Hailing from a small town in north-western Eswatini, she decided to chart her own path away from her family's expectations. After finishing medical school at the University of Botswana, Tandzile decided to go back to her home country Swaziland where she worked for three years.",
